id: SCA-058
title: NuGet config with cleartext credentials
category: supply-chain
severity: error
engine: pattern
target:
  filenames: nuget.config NuGet.Config NuGet.config
  exclude_paths: test/ node_modules/ .git/ vendor/
patterns:
  - regex: <add\s+key="ClearTextPassword"\s+value="
    message: NuGet config contains cleartext password — leaks registry credentials and enables dependency confusion.
fix: Use dotnet nuget add source with credential provider. Never store passwords in config files.
